{"type":"text","timestamp":1794304069328,"sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","part":{"id":"prt_1c4db4eb7001jWJ1MSzoZDqu3E","messageID":"msg_1c4db3f0e001b9q67Gw6rae32w","sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","type":"text","text":"<think>Wait, my oldString had a typo `SELECT *users` — but the edit succeeded? That's odd. Let me re-read the file to check what happened.\n\nActually the edit tool said \"Edit applied successfully\" — but the oldString should not have matched. Let me check the file content now.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794304069303,"end":1794304069323}}}
