{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794304298286,"sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","part":{"id":"prt_1c4decd1b001KzrJ71XePKTrz0","messageID":"msg_1c4deafec001nGaALz0VTrTOyd","sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794304298286,"sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","part":{"id":"prt_1c4decd1e001Cr0PjfqVwxdGvi","messageID":"msg_1c4deafec001nGaALz0VTrTOyd","sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","type":"text","text":"<think>Now the quiz view. Requirements:\n- One question at a time with its options as radio buttons, a progress indicator ('Question 2 of 5'), 'Next' and, on the last question, 'Submit'.\n- A result view with the score, the number correct and every question with the chosen and the correct option marked; visitors see a 'Sign in to save your results' prompt.\n\nLet me design the QuizPanel component that manages the quiz state (questions, answers), and a ResultView component.\n\nLet's think about the API flow:\n1. GET /api/quiz?count=5 -> items without correct_option\n2. POST /api/attempts with answers -> returns attempt with review.\n\nThe quiz panel will fetch questions, let user answer, then submit, then show result.\n\nFor a signed-in user the attempt is saved. The result view shows the score and number correct plus every question with chosen and correct option marked.\n\nLet me write the QuizPanel.\n\nAlso I want a \"review\" component shared for showing attempt results (used both after submit and when opening a saved attempt from history). Let me make an `AttemptReview` component.\n\nFor the review, the API returns answers with text, option_a..option_d, selected, correct_option, is_correct. So the review can be rendered directly from the attempt object.\n\nLet me write these.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794304298270,"end":1794304298283}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794304298312,"sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_LNBqp7fQa1iOlvPft8USyV2m","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import type { Attempt, AttemptAnswer } from \"@/types\";\n\nconst LETTERS = [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"] as const;\n\nexport function optionText(answer: AttemptAnswer, letter: string): string {\n  switch (letter) {\n    case \"A\":\n      return answer.option_a;\n    case \"B\":\n      return answer.option_b;\n    case \"C\":\n      return answer.option_c;\n    case \"D\":\n      return answer.option_d;\n    default:\n      return \"\";\n  }\n}\n\ninterface AttemptReviewProps {\n  attempt: Attempt;\n}\n\nexport default function AttemptReview({ attempt }: AttemptReviewProps) {\n  return (\n    <ol className=\"space-y-4\">\n      {attempt.answers.map((answer, index) => (\n        <li\n          key={answer.question_id}\n          className={`rounded-xl border p-4 ${\n            answer.is_correct ? \"border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/60\" : \"border-red-200 bg-red-50/60\"\n          }`}\n        >\n          <div className=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n            <span\n              className={`mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-xs font-bold ${\n                answer.is_correct ? \"bg-emerald-600 text-white\" : \"bg-red-600 text-white\"\n              }`}\n            >\n              {index + 1}\n            </span>\n            <div className=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">\n              <p className=\"font-medium text-slate-900\">{answer.text}</p>\n              <ul className=\"mt-3 space-y-1.5\">\n                {LETTERS.map((letter) => {\n                  const isSelected = answer.selected === letter;\n                  const isCorrect = answer.correct_option === letter;\n                  return (\n                    <li\n                      key={letter}\n                      className={`flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm ${\n                        isCorrect\n                          ? \"border-emerald-300 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-900\"\n                          : isSelected\n                            ? \"border-red-300 bg-red-100 text-red-900\"\n                            : \"border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-600\"\n                      }`}\n                    >\n                      <span className=\"font-bold\">{letter}.</span>\n                      <span className=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">{optionText(answer, letter)}</span>\n                      {isSelected && (\n                        <span className=\"rounded-full bg-slate-800 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-white\">\n                          Your answer\n                        </span>\n                      )}\n                      {isCorrect && (\n                        <span className=\"rounded-full bg-emerald-600 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-white\">\n                          Correct\n                        </span>\n                      )}\n                    </li>\n                  );\n                })}\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </li>\n      ))}\n    </ol>\n  );\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/AttemptReview.tsx"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/AttemptReview.tsx","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/components/AttemptReview.tsx","time":{"start":1794304298280,"end":1794304298289}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c4decd22001rIMb2lem7GF7qG","sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","messageID":"msg_1c4deafec001nGaALz0VTrTOyd"}}
