{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794304313312,"sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","part":{"id":"prt_1c4df07cc001DqX2jDtc6ObiiM","messageID":"msg_1c4decd41001MPUAPcoojmRrD8","sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794304313312,"sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","part":{"id":"prt_1c4df07cf001YjpkV3F2Dtpz47","messageID":"msg_1c4decd41001MPUAPcoojmRrD8","sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","type":"text","text":"<think>Now the QuizPanel: draws questions, one at a time, radio buttons, progress indicator 'Question 2 of 5', Next / Submit buttons.\n\nAlso need a result view: score, number correct, every question with chosen and correct option marked; visitors see 'Sign in to save your results' prompt.\n\nLet me design the flow:\n- QuizPanel holds state: items (from GET /api/quiz?count=N), index, answers.\n- On last question \"Submit\" -> POST /api/attempts -> show result view.\n- Result view shows score, number correct, review, and if not signed in -> \"Sign in to save your results\" prompt.\n\nLet me make the quiz component handle both playing and result.\n\nAlso I need a \"number of questions\" selector maybe. Let's keep it simple: a start screen with count selection (5 default). Actually the spec says \"Anyone can draw a short random quiz of multiple-choice questions\". A start screen lets user pick count. Let me include a simple start screen with count options (5, 10).\n\nLet me write QuizPanel.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794304313295,"end":1794304313307}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794304313333,"sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_g04Ps5k7xel0s3Iv5bGLqcgz","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import { useCallback, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { ApiError, apiRequest } from \"@/api\";\nimport type { Attempt, QuizItem } from \"@/types\";\nimport AttemptReview from \"./AttemptReview\";\n\nconst LETTERS = [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"] as const;\n\nconst OPTION_KEYS = {\n  A: \"option_a\",\n  B: \"option_b\",\n  C: \"option_c\",\n  D: \"option_d\",\n} as const;\n\ninterface QuizPanelProps {\n  isSignedIn: boolean;\n  onRequireSignIn: () => void;\n}\n\nexport default function QuizPanel({ isSignedIn, onRequireSignIn }: QuizPanelProps) {\n  const [phase, setPhase] = useState<\"start\" | \"playing\" | \"result\">(\"start\");\n  const [count, setCount] = useState(5);\n  const [items, setItems] = useState<QuizItem[]>([]);\n  const [index, setIndex] = useState(0);\n  const [answers, setAnswers] = useState<Record<number, string>>({});\n  const [attempt, setAttempt] = useState<Attempt | null>(null);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);\n  const [error, setError] = useState(\"\");\n\n  const start = useCallback(async () => {\n    setLoading(true);\n    setError(\"\");\n    try {\n      const result = await apiRequest<{ items: QuizItem[] }>(`/api/quiz?count=${count}`);\n      setItems(result.items);\n      setAnswers({});\n      setIndex(0);\n      setAttempt(null);\n      setPhase(\"playing\");\n    } catch (err) {\n      setError(err instanceof ApiError ? err.message : \"Could not load the quiz.\");\n    } finally {\n      setLoading(false);\n    }\n  }, [count]);\n\n  const submit = useCallback(async () => {\n    setLoading(true);\n    setError(\"\");\n    try {\n      const payload = items.map((item) => ({\n        question_id: item.id,\n        selected: answers[item.id],\n      }));\n      const result = await apiRequest<Attempt>(\"/api/attempts\", {\n        method: \"POST\",\n        body: { answers: payload },\n      });\n      setAttempt(result);\n      setPhase(\"result\");\n    } catch (err) {\n      setError(err instanceof ApiError ? err.message : \"Could not submit your answers.\");\n    } finally {\n      setLoading(false);\n    }\n  }, [answers, items]);\n\n  if (phase === \"result\" && attempt) {\n    return (\n      <section className=\"space-y-6\">\n        <div className=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8\">\n          <p className=\"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-indigo-600\">\n            Results\n          </p>\n          <div className=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-end gap-x-8 gap-y-3\">\n            <div>\n              <p className=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900\">\n                {Math.round(attempt.score)}%\n              </p>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">Your score</p>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <p className=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900\">{attempt.correct}</p>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">\n                Correct out of {attempt.total_questions}\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {!isSignedIn && (\n            <div className=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-3\">\n              <p className=\"text-sm font-medium text-amber-900\">\n                Sign in to save your results\n              </p>\n              <button\n                type=\"button\"\n                onClick={onRequireSignIn}\n                className=\"rounded-lg bg-amber-600 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-amber-700\"\n              >\n                Sign in\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          )}\n\n          <div className=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3\">\n            <button\n              type=\"button\"\n              onClick={() => setPhase(\"start\")}\n              className=\"rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-indigo-700\"\n            >\n              Play again\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <AttemptReview attempt={attempt} />\n      </section>\n    );\n  }\n\n  if (phase === \"start\" || items.length === 0) {\n    return (\n      <section className=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8\">\n        <h2 className=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Start a quiz</h2>\n        <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">\n          Answer a handful of general-knowledge questions and see how you score.\n        </p>\n\n        <div className=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-end gap-4\">\n          <div>\n            <label\n              htmlFor=\"count\"\n              className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700\"\n            >\n              Number of questions\n            </label>\n            <select\n              id=\"count\"\n              value={count}\n              onChange={(event) => setCount(Number(event.target.value))}\n              className=\"mt-1 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500\"\n            >\n              <option value={3}>3</option>\n              <option value={5}>5</option>\n              <option value={10}>10</option>\n              <option value={20}>20</option>\n            </select>\n          </div>\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            onClick={start}\n            disabled={loading}\n            className=\"rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-indigo-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\"\n          >\n            {loading ? \"Loading...\" : \"Start quiz\"}\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        {error && (\n          <div className=\"mt-4 rounded-lg border border-red-200 bg-red-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-red-700\">\n            {error}\n          </div>\n        )}\n      </section>\n    );\n  }\n\n  const item = items[index];\n  const selected = answers[item.id] ?? \"\";\n  const isLast = index === items.length - 1;\n\n  return (\n    <section className=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8\">\n      <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n        <p className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600\">\n          Question {index + 1} of {items.length}\n        </p>\n        <div className=\"h-2 w-32 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-200 sm:w-48\">\n          <div\n            className=\"h-full rounded-full bg-indigo-600 transition-all\"\n            style={{ width: `${((index + 1) / items.length) * 100}%` }}\n          />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 className=\"mt-4 text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-slate-900\">\n        {item.text}\n      </h2>\n\n      <div className=\"mt-5 space-y-2\">\n        {LETTERS.map((letter) => (\n          <label\n            key={letter}\n            className={`flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border px-4 py-3 text-sm transition ${\n              selected === letter\n                ? \"border-indigo-500 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-900\"\n                : \"border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-700 hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-50\"\n            }`}\n          >\n            <input\n              type=\"radio\"\n              name={`question-${item.id}`}\n              value={letter}\n              checked={selected === letter}\n              onChange={() => setAnswers((prev) => ({ ...prev, [item.id]: letter }))}\n              className=\"h-4 w-4 accent-indigo-600\"\n            />\n            <span className=\"font-bold\">{letter}.</span>\n            <span className=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">{item[OPTION_KEYS[letter]]}</span>\n          </label>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n\n      {error && (\n        <div className=\"mt-4 rounded-lg border border-red-200 bg-red-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-red-700\">\n          {error}\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      <div className=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n        <button\n          type=\"button\"\n          onClick={() => setIndex((prev) => Math.max(0, prev - 1))}\n          disabled={index === 0}\n          className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40\"\n        >\n          Back\n        </button>\n        {isLast ? (\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            onClick={submit}\n            disabled={loading || Object.keys(answers).length < items.length}\n            className=\"rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-indigo-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\"\n          >\n            {loading ? \"Submitting...\" : \"Submit\"}\n          </button>\n        ) : (\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            onClick={() => setIndex((prev) => Math.min(items.length - 1, prev + 1))}\n            disabled={!selected}\n            className=\"rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-indigo-700 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\"\n          >\n            Next\n          </button>\n        )}\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/QuizPanel.tsx"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/components/QuizPanel.tsx","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/components/QuizPanel.tsx","time":{"start":1794304313304,"end":1794304313315}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c4df07d20019hfOO15ZKw2947","sessionID":"ses_e3b28f934ffeJmeWt8viIcFs1W","messageID":"msg_1c4decd41001MPUAPcoojmRrD8"}}
